  "instructions": "Complements official Beads and Dolt MCP tools with provenance, original-file imports, local exports and full database backups. Tasks, persistent memories and research data are different objects. A task closure or version commit does not prove scientific validity. Preserve source bytes, hashes, branch and commit, missingness, criteria and reading level. Create working branches before imports. Backups are on the same disk and do not include external original files unless separately copied. Restore only into new copies. No network accounts, remote publications, credential disclosure or destructive cleanup.",
